{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"statistics-lesson03","version":1,"title":"数理統計","subtitle":"第3回 · 元の資料4・正規ベクトルの直交分解","scope":"数理統計4.pdf、全16物理ページ。元の資料4・正規ベクトルの直交分解。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木１]数理統計/数理統計4.pdf","sha256":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea","pageCount":16,"reviewedPages":[1,5,8,9,14],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"statistics-l03-q01","version":1,"prompt":"独立なガンマ変数\\(X\\sim Ga(\\alpha_1,\\beta)\\)、\\(Y\\sim Ga(\\alpha_2,\\beta)\\)の和の分布は？第2引数βは共通の尺度とする。","answer":"\\(X+Y\\sim Ga(\\alpha_1+\\alpha_2,\\beta)\\)。","criterion":"形状を足し、共通の尺度を保てれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":1,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:1"}],"promptHtml":"独立なガンマ変数<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim Ga(\\alpha_1,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y\\sim Ga(\\alpha_2,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span>の和の分布は？第2引数βは共通の尺度とする。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X+Y\\sim Ga(\\alpha_1+\\alpha_2,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"形状を足し、共通の尺度を保てれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l03-q02","version":1,"prompt":"単位ベクトルuの方向への、実ベクトルxの直交射影Pxは？","answer":"\\(Px=\\langle x,u\\rangle u=uu^{\\mathsf T}x\\)。","criterion":"u方向の成分だけを取り出す式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":5,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:5"}],"promptHtml":"単位ベクトルuの方向への、実ベクトルxの直交射影Pxは？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Px=\\langle x,u\\rangle u=uu^{\\mathsf T}x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"u方向の成分だけを取り出す式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l03-q03","version":1,"prompt":"\\(X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)\\)、σ>0。正規直交基底u1,…,unでの成分\\(\\langle X,u_i\\rangle\\)の分布と独立性は？","answer":"互いに独立で、それぞれ\\(N(0,\\sigma^2)\\)。","criterion":"正規直交変換後も独立な同じ正規分布と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:8"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、σ&gt;0。正規直交基底u1,…,unでの成分<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle X,u_i\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span>の分布と独立性は？","answerHtml":"互いに独立で、それぞれ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(0,\\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"正規直交変換後も独立な同じ正規分布と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l03-q04","version":1,"prompt":"\\(X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)\\)、σ>0、uは単位ベクトル、P=uuᵀとする。PXと(I−P)Xの独立性は？","answer":"互いに独立。","criterion":"直交する2成分が独立と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:9"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、σ&gt;0、uは単位ベクトル、P=uuᵀとする。PXと(I−P)Xの独立性は？","answerHtml":"互いに独立。","criterionHtml":"直交する2成分が独立と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l03-q05","version":1,"prompt":"\\(X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)\\)、σ>0、uは単位ベクトル、P=uuᵀ。\\(\\lVert(I-P)X\\rVert^2/\\sigma^2\\)の分布は？","answer":"自由度n−1のカイ二乗分布。","criterion":"射影先の次元n−1が自由度になると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:9"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N_n(0,\\sigma^2I)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、σ&gt;0、uは単位ベクトル、P=uuᵀ。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert(I-P)X\\rVert^2/\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>の分布は？","answerHtml":"自由度n−1のカイ二乗分布。","criterionHtml":"射影先の次元n−1が自由度になると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l03-q06","version":1,"prompt":"独立な正規標本X1,…,Xnを平均方向と残差方向に直交分解すると、標本平均と不偏分散の独立性をどう説明できる？","answer":"標本平均は平均方向の成分、不偏分散は独立な残差方向の成分だけで決まるため。","criterion":"独立な直交成分の関数であると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計4.pdf","page":14,"imageKey":"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:14"}],"promptHtml":"独立な正規標本X1,…,Xnを平均方向と残差方向に直交分解すると、標本平均と不偏分散の独立性をどう説明できる？","answerHtml":"標本平均は平均方向の成分、不偏分散は独立な残差方向の成分だけで決まるため。","criterionHtml":"独立な直交成分の関数であると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:1":"./assets/sources/fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea-1.png","fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:5":"./assets/sources/fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea-5.png","fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:8":"./assets/sources/fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea-8.png","fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:9":"./assets/sources/fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea-9.png","fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea:14":"./assets/sources/fbbaec328f3f0b49ad1dafcc8b3ed4c26190b8067a39f8987534fd7431ed0bea-14.png"},"renderVersion":1}